    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d455">

                <pb facs="0564" n="456" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg456"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Quiney to Señor Romero.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-08-12"><hi rendition="#italic">August 12,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Romero</hi>: I am in receipt of a letter
                    from the Secretary of War, of the 9th instant, confirming a telegram from Brig.
                    Gen. Frank Wheaton, commanding the Department of Texas, dated the 5th instant,
                    wherein it is stated that Maj. Keyes, in command of Fort Ringgold, reports the
                    arrest of Justo Yela, Anciano Sanchez, Felipe Trevino, and Sesstores Lemon, the
                    two first being San Ignacio men, and the last two Garza men.</p>
                <p>Very truly, yours,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Josiah Quincy.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
